            <note corresp="#d226-f4" n="47" xml:id="d226-f4-content">
                <p>Not printed: the Embassy, in despatch 329, requested that 32 names be deleted
                    from the Proclaimed List in lieu of the failure to make wholesale deletions on
                    June 8, which would have left only hard core cases (740.16112A/6–2145).</p>
            </note>
